{"id":"hniidar6d3vhffh1lf26kogoj","title":"城市生活在柏林松鼠的基因中留下微妙痕迹","originalTitle":"City life leaves subtle genetic traces in Berlin squirrels","summary":"一项由莱布尼茨动物园与野生动物研究所和柏林技术大学的研究团队进行的研究发现，柏林不同区域的松鼠存在微妙的基因差异，表明城市化可能限制了松鼠之间的基因交流。尽管如此，这些差异尚未显著影响松鼠的生存概率。研究发表在《生态与进化》杂志上。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-city-life-subtle-genetic-berlin.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T13:40:07.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T13:52:22.685Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T13:52:22.685Z","category":"life-science","tags":["研究成果","基因治疗"],"score":35,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"c5ce18c0-53e7-4c3a-8e70-153536d3532b","title":"莱布尼茨动物园等团队发现柏林松鼠基因分化与生存概率关联性有限"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"c5ce18c0-53e7-4c3a-8e70-153536d3532b","title":"莱布尼茨动物园等团队发现柏林松鼠基因分化与生存概率关联性有限"}],"topics":[{"slug":"gene-editing","name":"基因编辑与 CRISPR"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f3z8201I5Hko","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}